# Experiment output — regenerated, never committed
experiments/
experiment/data/
experiment/data_synth/
*.npz
*.pt
*.bundle
nvml.csv
energibridge*.csv

# Model weights and serving logs
# Anchored to the repo root with a leading slash. An unanchored `models/`
# matches at ANY depth, and Git's ignore matching is case-insensitive on
# Windows -- so it silently swallowed the vendored experiment-runner's
# ConfigValidator/Config/Models/, EventManager/Models/ and
# ProgressManager/RunTable/Models/ packages. The repo cloned "successfully"
# and failed at import time on the server.
/models/
*.gguf
*.safetensors
vllm_*.log

